## Anti-patterns

| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| Sol as default second opinion | Grok first; Sol for code review / hard escalation |
| Treating Sol/CritPt winner as validator | Sol = hypothesis; xfemm/gates = validation |
| Picking models on GPQA | Ignore GPQA; use CritPt + honesty + cost + return rate |
| Asking MiniMax to size magnets | MiniMax: “is the claim supported?” |
| DeepSeek as physics authority or auditor | Cheap voice only |
| GLM as standing first call after demotion | Optional corroborator only |
| One model self-grades green | Triad or full council |
| Accepting Sol without MiniMax/solver check | Escalation always dual-checked |
| Divergent ids in `council_models` vs `model_routing` | Facade + `--selftest` must stay green |
